---
title: "Mini recovered-forward descendant upgrade gate"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: recovery
    lg1: forward
    lg2: ready
    lg3: held
    lg4: Breaks VerifiedLaterReleaseRemainsUpgradeable in some cases
    lg5: Path to the VerifiedLaterReleaseRemainsUpgradeable bug
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 purple
  class lg3 orange
  class lg4 mayBreak
  class lg5 bugPath
  s0: Recovery receipt verified#59; recovery release active
  s1: Signed but unrelated release active
  s2: First forward upgrade allowed
  s3: Signed descendant active#59; recovery receipt retained
  s4: Upgrade held by operation-mode or recovery-lineage gate
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: observe a signed release outside the recovery candidate's lineage
  s0 --> s2: check retained evidence and current signed lineage
  s1 --> s4: check retained evidence and current signed lineage#59; upgrade held
  s2 --> s3: promote the first signed descendant through the controller
  s3 --> s4: request upgrade while the operation mode is not admitted
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 orange
  class s2 purple
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 teal
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 orange
  class s4 mayBreak
  class s4 bugPath
